        "id": "raynor",
        "name": "Raynor"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Since Lúcio relies heavily on his High Five to save allies, Heroes with persistent cc abilities on the ground like Entangling Roots or Stay Awhile and Listen are effective against him, as he often gets caught in these when trying to help teammates. Lúcio also struggles against Heroes with long range and single-target damage, like Raynor or Sgt. Hammer."
